Title: The House 
Credit: Written By
Author: Justin Del Vecchio
Draft date: May 2026

INT. COFFEE SHOP - MORNING
Brilliant morning.  Coffee shop similar to a Dunkin Donuts.  Mixture of people and kids going to school, etc.  

MIKA BOYKO is in line.  He is in his early 60s, Ukranian accent.  He is annoyed and looks disapprovingly at person in front of hime.  The cutomer oblivously checks phone while cashier holds out change for purchase.

MIKA
Ahem

CUSTOMER
Oh hey, thanks! Thanks!

Collects change and moves along.  Mika places two dollars and one quarter on counter.

MIKA
Hi, ususal.


Mika takes coffee, finds table and sits with two friends.  Older, clearly retirees.

FRIEND 1
Hey Mika, ho are you doing.

MIKA
OK.  Got up early, wathced sun rise, and walked here.  Traffic ridiculous today.  Crazy.  People speeed like made right by school.

