Coffee is weak today.  Who make this!  Ok, so, that is alll good.  All fine.  Sister OK with everything.  Wife OK with everything.  All  we need to do is sell house, get money, move on.

Immediately break

INT.  Kitchen of an older tudor home.  Mika is inside with his wife Nona.  Nona is impeccabily dressed.  She is beautiful.  Both sit at the kitchen table.  For some reason Nona is eatin a sausage McMuffin.

MIKA
All he have to do is sell the house.  Put it on the market.  Set a reasonable price, I know what that price is, and we are good.

NONA
I know.  I know!  we can see the house and then, we can think about a condo in Ft. Lauderdale.

MIKA
I keep telling you - there is no way we can get a anything good in Ft. Lauderdal for the price we can get for this house no way -

